WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.072 --> 00:00:10.777
It is a warm day on a sandy beach.

2
00:00:10.778 --> 00:00:17.463
Beneath the sand, a baby green sea turtle is hatching.

3
00:00:17.464 --> 00:00:21.765
"Let me out!" Jade cries.

4
00:00:21.766 --> 00:00:27.057
She has a special egg tooth.

5
00:00:27.058 --> 00:00:31.688
She uses it to peck at the eggshell. Crack!

6
00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:34.798
Jade is free!

7
00:00:34.799 --> 00:00:38.990
About a hundred other hatchlings are in the nest too.

8
00:00:38.991 --> 00:00:44.177
"I'm Olive," one says. "We're sisters."

9
00:00:44.178 --> 00:00:48.205
"What do we do now?" Jade asks.

10
00:00:48.206 --> 00:00:53.790
Olive shrugs. "Everyone is waiting here for now."

11
00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:58.276
Later the warm sand cools.

12
00:00:58.277 --> 00:01:04.086
One hatchling starts to dig up through the sand.

13
00:01:04.087 --> 00:01:08.453
"Let's dig up too!" Jade says.

14
00:01:08.454 --> 00:01:16.521
The hatchlings dig for hours.

15
00:01:16.522 --> 00:01:20.743
At last Jade breaks through!

16
00:01:20.744 --> 00:01:24.426
The air feels cool and fresh.

17
00:01:24.427 --> 00:01:29.885
Jade can't see very well, so everything is a blur.

18
00:01:29.886 --> 00:01:33.702
But there is light in one direction.

19
00:01:33.703 --> 00:01:37.321
"Let's go that way."

20
00:01:37.322 --> 00:01:42.033
Jade uses her tiny flippers to move across the sand.

21
00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:46.305
The other hatchlings move too.

22
00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:49.685
"Where are we going?" Olive asks.

23
00:01:49.686 --> 00:01:53.016
"I don't know," Jade says.

24
00:01:53.017 --> 00:01:56.645
"But I'll know the place when I see it."

25
00:01:56.646 --> 00:02:01.378
Soon driftwood blocks their way.

26
00:02:01.379 --> 00:02:05.487
"We have to go around it," Jade says.

27
00:02:05.488 --> 00:02:11.376
"I'm so tired!" Olive moans.

28
00:02:11.377 --> 00:02:15.494
"We can do it," Jade says.

29
00:02:15.495 --> 00:02:19.417
A large crab comes toward them.

30
00:02:19.418 --> 00:02:23.208
It snaps its claws!

31
00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:33.487
Jade gulps and pushes Olive away.

32
00:02:33.488 --> 00:02:38.259
"Phew!" Olive says.

33
00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:45.749
Next, gulls dive toward the hatchlings. Squawk!

34
00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:55.094
"Hurry!" Olive shoves Jade aside.

35
00:02:55.095 --> 00:03:00.213
At last the two hatchlings reach the ocean.

36
00:03:00.214 --> 00:03:03.958
Jade dives into a breaking wave.

37
00:03:03.959 --> 00:03:09.436
She gets carried into deeper water.

38
00:03:09.437 --> 00:03:17.716
"Olive? Where are you?" she cries.

39
00:03:17.717 --> 00:03:20.992
Jade can see much better underwater.

40
00:03:20.993 --> 00:03:24.125
But hatchlings are everywhere!

41
00:03:24.126 --> 00:03:27.665
Which one is Olive?

42
00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:34.384
"Here I am, Jade!" Olive swims over.

43
00:03:34.385 --> 00:03:39.458
"What now?" Olive asks.

44
00:03:39.459 --> 00:03:43.792
Jade shoots through the water with her strong flippers.

45
00:03:43.793 --> 00:03:46.167
It feels great!

46
00:03:46.168 --> 00:03:59.139
"Now we swim, swim, swim!"

